<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58065" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλώθω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκλωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					2.678
				</span></i>
			, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ</span>-) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.208
			</span></i>:—<i>twist by spinning, spin</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.12
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1414.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Fug.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἄτρακτον</span>
			<i>turn</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JConf.</u>
				19
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύσσος κεκλωσμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					35.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. of the
			goddesses of fate, <i>spin</i> a man his thread of life or of
			fate, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τινὶ τὰ οἰκεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					401b22
				</span></i>
			:—poet. in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλώσασθε πανάφθιτον ἦμαρ ἀοιδῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.14
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antip.Sid.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτὰ δέ μοι μοῖραι . . ἐνιαυτοὺς
					ἐκλώσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.1337
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς μοιρῶν μίτον ὔμμιν
			ἐκλώσατο</span>; ib.<i><span class="en">
				5(1).1355
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Abia</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κλωσθέντα</span>
			<i>one's destiny</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				960c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυλῷ ἐνὶ κλώθοντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					93
				</span></i>
			 (expld. by Sch. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς νῆμα
			κλωθομένῳ</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				528
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
